  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Stricter, extraterritorial sanctions enforcement (including secondary sanctions) exposes allied firms and banks to penalties, creating diplomatic disputes and coordination frictions that erode trust and practical cohesion among US partners in the region.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_iran_confrontation</data>
  <data key="d39">north_korea_standoff</data>
</edge>
