  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Stricter enforcement (e.g., penalties on correspondent banks and tightened compliance) directly disrupts dollar clearing and correspondent relationships, prompting the Fed to expand liquidity facilities and swap/standing repo operations to backstop dollar funding and market functioning.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_iran_confrontation</data>
  <data key="d39">us_treasury_market_stres</data>
