  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">A high tempo of Russian ballistic/cruise strikes that demonstrate ability to overwhelm or bypass allied air defenses lowers regional perceptions that US/ROK missile defenses would reliably stop a large DPRK salvo, reducing deterrence credibility.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
