  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">An increased tempo of missile strikes raises demand for remote, explosive‑ordnance and reconnaissance robots for inspection, repair and force protection, accelerating procurement and field deployments.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">tech_semiconductor_rival</data>
