  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Sharp increases in missile_attack_rate trigger immediate risk‑off flows into on‑the‑run US Treasuries, concentrating buy orders and temporarily deepening and tightening secondary‑market liquidity for those benchmark securities.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
