  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Sustained central‑bank balance‑sheet tightening (asset sales/roll‑off) lifts long‑term yields and risk premia, raising discount rates and making large, long‑dated semiconductor and data‑center investments less attractive, thereby slowing capital allocation to AI hardware.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">us_treasury_market_stres</data>
