  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Increased capital directed to AI hardware accelerates deployment of AI‑enabled ISR, targeting and missile‑defense upgrades on the peninsula, which raises the perceived effectiveness of allied deterrent capabilities.</data>
