  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">Longer lead times for critical AI chips delay procurement and fielding of upgrades to defensive and autonomous systems, degrading operational readiness and thus perceived deterrent credibility.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">tech_semiconductor_rival</data>
  <data key="d39">north_korea_standoff</data>
