  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.55</data>
  <data key="d36">Extended lead times for critical semiconductor components heighten policymakers' urgency and perceived proliferation risk, motivating legislators and administrations to broaden or intensify sanctions aimed at preventing Iran from sourcing scarce dual‑use items.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
