  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Stronger alignment within allied networks enables coordinated policymaking and synchronized export-control packages that raise the restrictiveness and scope of AI-related trade controls across multiple jurisdictions.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">north_korea_standoff</data>
  <data key="d39">tech_semiconductor_rival</data>
